    "lot_measurement": "Flat empty-ground connected component ellipse at fixed game seed,88base vs themed map. Christmas snow checked by physical rim ellipse where flat-color segmentation is unsuitable.",
    "rotation": "Preview uses original pivot, +2degrees, bicubic only for display. Published alpha remains binary."
